**NR means the source does not report the fieldwork year or denominator.** Publication year is not substituted for data year. Values with NR are leads for checking, not presentation-ready national estimates.

### 1. Pedestrian yield rate

| Number | Unit | Site / n / year | Road type | Source (link) | Quote or table ref | FACT/JUDGMENT | Verified full text? |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
