### 3. Two-wheeler lateral gaps and shifts

Let \(v\) be the **pair’s average speed in km/h** and \(C\) its modelled lateral clearance in **cm**.

| Number | Unit | Site / n / year | Road type | Source (link) | Quote or table ref | FACT/JUDGMENT | Verified full text? |
