| Bike–bike: **C = 118.02 + 0.224v**; car–bike: **C = 125.16 + 0.612v**; auto–bike: **C = 117.27 + 0.739v** | cm; slope is cm per km/h | Delhi, Guwahati, Kolkata, Bengaluru, Pune, Mumbai; pair n=87, 1,372, 417 respectively; data year NR | Mixed-traffic road stretches during lateral passing/interaction | Budhkar & Maurya, [publisher PDF](https://link.springer.com/content/pdf/10.1007/s40534-017-0130-1.pdf) | Table 4 rows: `Bike–Bike 87 0.224 118.02`; `Car–Bike 1372 0.612 125.16`; `Auto–Bike 417 0.739 117.27` | FACT; fitted relationships | **Yes** |

